'''The Endless Wood''' (アドベン大森林, ''Adoben Dai Shinrin'', '''Adven Great Forest''') is the 3rd sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 52nd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|version 7.1]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
The difficulty level of The Endless Wood isn't too much greater than the [[Here Be Dragons|previous sub-chapter]], although some stages may be tricky to beat. It's recommended to get [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] or a good anti-everything [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] at this point, as [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] are starting to become real threats.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Sir Rel]]: A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Squire Rel]] with a guaranteed Curse effect. Has exceptional speed and DPS along with high health for a peon, but is single-target and gets knocked back easily. Drops even less money than Squire Rel.

